  "system": {
    "description": {
      "type": "String",
      "label": "Description",
      "value": "<p><strong>Minor Physical Mutation</strong></p><p>Your neck thickens as your tongue becomes long, sinuous and ending in a sharp point - it extends down your throat to some hidden cavity in your chest. You can launch your tongue at opponents up to 4 yards away dealing SB Damage on a successful Ballistic Skill Test. Your tongue has the Precise Weapon Quality. Roll 1d10; on 9-10 you gain the @UUID[Compendium.wfrp4e-core.items.Item.gFkRm9wS65qe18Xv]{Venom (Average)} Creature Trait. If you have the @UUID[Compendium.artantares-mutations.items.Item.ZoRt8G8M0xyfdQpY]{Bloodsucker} Mutation you may lodge the tongue in your victim and cause 1 Wound per Round until the victim succeeds with an <strong>Opposed Strength</strong> Test or cuts off your tongue (which can sustain 2 Wounds). Your tongue will regrow at the rate of 2 inches per week if cut off. You can only gain this mutation once.</p>"
    },
